# Build context for deploy/local/Dockerfile.web, the repository root.
# The build reads the workspace files at the root and the web packages;
# a package's installed or built output is rebuilt inside, never copied.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!platform-web
!cowork/engine
!cowork-web
!lib/design
!lib/platform-sdk-ts
!site-web
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
